{"id":"medi-cal-enrolment","tier":"OFFICIAL","title":"Medi-Cal enrolment, month by month","question":"How many Californians were enrolled in Medi-Cal each month, and did the count change after the January 2026 freeze?","finding":"Certified Medi-Cal enrolment was 14,781,191 in June 2025, 14,432,529 in December 2025 and 13,675,721 in June 2026: 756,808 fewer in the six months after the freeze on new adult enrolment in State-only coverage began, against 348,662 fewer in the six months before. 4,561,673 were adults in the federal expansion group (ages 19 to 64) in June 2026. The publication gives no count by immigration status, so it cannot say how much of the fall is the freeze.","how":"Monthly totals from Table 1 of Fast Facts (September 2026 edition, data to June 2026). The six-month differences are this project’s arithmetic.","limits":"The counts are preliminary and cover about 99 in 100 enrollees for the latest month; renewals, the end of pandemic rules and the freeze all move the count. No county and no immigration-status figure is in this publication.","columns":[{"k":"month","t":"Month","type":"text"},{"k":"enrolled","t":"Certified eligibles","type":"int"}],"rows":[{"month":"2026-06","enrolled":13675721},{"month":"2026-05","enrolled":13825834},{"month":"2026-04","enrolled":13974596},{"month":"2026-03","enrolled":14111630},{"month":"2026-02","enrolled":14213964},{"month":"2026-01","enrolled":14359871},{"month":"2025-12","enrolled":14432529},{"month":"2025-11","enrolled":14475583},{"month":"2025-10","enrolled":14551852},{"month":"2025-09","enrolled":14603021},{"month":"2025-08","enrolled":14682957},{"month":"2025-07","enrolled":14784160},{"month":"2025-06","enrolled":14781191},{"month":"2025-05","enrolled":14812683},{"month":"2025-04","enrolled":14841548},{"month":"2025-03","enrolled":14889779},{"month":"2025-02","enrolled":14915741},{"month":"2025-01","enrolled":14945346},{"month":"2024-12","enrolled":14896006},{"month":"2024-11","enrolled":14892779},{"month":"20